  ('Prestbury Plant and Garden', 'GARDEN CENTRE', '{}', 1, 'prestbury', 'cheshire', 53.284, -2.149, false, '{none}', '{}', 'An independent family''s own nursery on London Road since 1984 — plants grown or sourced as close to home as the Cheshire soil allows, a flower shop alongside it, and no loyalty scheme standing in for actually knowing the regulars.', '{"morning","afternoon"}', 52, 'Not yet Gate 1 reviewed — raw daily research candidate, no independent verification pass has run on it.', null, null, null, '[{"note":"Raw daily-research candidate from docs/data/venue-suggestions.json, suggested 2026-10-09 — not yet independently re-verified by a second review pass. Synced 2026-10-12 for direct human review at /admin/review."}]'::jsonb, 'pending_review'),
